WEBVTT

00:36.501 --> 00:39.454
Boss! Boss!

00:40.176 --> 00:41.328
What's that?

00:41.328 --> 00:43.550
Hey, you masked punk! You're dead now!

00:43.550 --> 00:44.593
What are you waiting for?

00:44.593 --> 00:46.470
Hurry up and attack!

00:46.470 --> 00:47.929
Attack him already! Hurry up!

00:47.929 --> 00:49.681
Come on! Hurry! Hurry up!

00:49.681 --> 00:51.933
Boss!

00:51.933 --> 00:54.192
- What?
- What is he?

00:58.148 --> 00:59.376
Darn you.

01:11.454 --> 01:12.454
Jeez, you little punk...

01:12.454 --> 01:13.705
Hey, hey! Get up!

01:13.705 --> 01:15.499
You punk, come here.

01:15.499 --> 01:17.125
Jeez, this punk...

01:17.125 --> 01:18.992
He's still alive.

01:22.224 --> 01:23.382
Darn it!

01:23.382 --> 01:24.841
Bathroom...

01:24.841 --> 01:27.219
There's a big problem in the bathroom now!

01:27.219 --> 01:29.379
Come to the bathroom now!

01:36.645 --> 01:38.563
Boss!

01:38.563 --> 01:39.760
Boss!

01:44.111 --> 01:45.404
Hey, hey!

01:45.404 --> 01:48.189
Go, go, go, hurry!

01:53.912 --> 01:55.613
Hey, lock the door!

02:37.552 --> 02:38.672
It hurts!

02:39.583 --> 02:41.284
Boss In Goo!

02:47.504 --> 02:49.040
You punk!

03:27.547 --> 03:28.632
Hear that?

03:28.632 --> 03:31.209
That means you're dead now.

03:33.552 --> 03:35.298
Darn it!

04:06.336 --> 04:07.462
- Huh?
- What's going on?

04:07.462 --> 04:08.463
- Turn on the light!
- Turn on the circuit breaker!

04:08.463 --> 04:10.164
- Hey, hey!
- What's this?

04:10.832 --> 04:12.592
- What's this?
- Where'd he go?

04:12.592 --> 04:13.969
- Hurry up!
- Find him quickly!

04:13.969 --> 04:16.045
Search for him now!

04:57.232 --> 04:59.788
[O Ran Chinese Restaurant]

05:18.158 --> 05:19.701
Where have you been?

05:19.701 --> 05:20.827
You didn't even answer your phone.

05:20.827 --> 05:24.205
Ho Myung, things are urgent now,
so quiet down...

05:24.205 --> 05:25.457
Huh?

05:25.457 --> 05:27.375
What happened to your face? Did you get hurt?

05:27.375 --> 05:30.837
I just took a little tumble
riding my motorcycle.

05:30.837 --> 05:32.672
I'll take a rest.

05:32.672 --> 05:34.341
I need a word.

05:34.341 --> 05:35.592
You two can leave work first.

05:35.592 --> 05:38.219
Okay, then you two finish things up.

05:38.219 --> 05:39.930
- Let's go!
- No way!

05:39.930 --> 05:42.724
We should hear what's going on too.

05:42.724 --> 05:43.808
We have to go now.

05:43.808 --> 05:44.851
It's time to go.

05:44.851 --> 05:46.552
Let's just go!

05:58.615 --> 06:00.825
Tell me.

06:00.825 --> 06:02.494
Why didn't you answer your phone all day?

06:02.494 --> 06:04.537
Why are you dragging yourself home

06:04.537 --> 06:06.864
looking like that at this hour?

06:08.249 --> 06:10.335
I went for a delivery

06:10.335 --> 06:11.711
and took a spill on the motorcycle.

06:11.711 --> 06:13.880
When I came to, it was already this late.

06:13.880 --> 06:15.340
Where?

06:15.340 --> 06:17.634
Mr. Kim searched the whole neighborhood

06:17.634 --> 06:19.511
and couldn't find you.

06:19.511 --> 06:21.805
Let's talk later.

06:21.805 --> 06:22.973
We talk now.

06:22.973 --> 06:24.224
Can't you see I'm hurt?

06:24.224 --> 06:25.266
Exactly.

06:25.266 --> 06:27.852
What were you doing to end up hurt like this

06:27.852 --> 06:30.262
and miss picking up Ji Woo?

06:32.691 --> 06:34.317
Don't tell me...

06:34.317 --> 06:36.861
Did it only just occur to you now?

06:36.861 --> 06:38.113
Are you out of your mind?

06:38.113 --> 06:40.407
Ji Woo...

06:40.407 --> 06:43.868
That six-year-old kid

06:43.868 --> 06:47.080
for 30 minutes because you didn't show up!

06:47.080 --> 06:48.164
Is Ji Woo okay?

06:48.164 --> 06:49.708
So it's fine as long as he's okay?

06:49.708 --> 06:52.377
What if he'd gotten into an accident

06:52.377 --> 06:53.962
walking alone?

06:53.962 --> 06:57.039
What if he'd gotten lost?

07:00.427 --> 07:01.803
I'm sorry.

07:01.803 --> 07:03.096
Sorry?

07:03.096 --> 07:04.514
For what?

07:04.514 --> 07:06.850
Why are you always like this? Huh?

07:06.850 --> 07:09.468
Why can't you ever just say things straight?

07:12.480 --> 07:15.182
You're just gonna keep your mouth shut?

08:00.976 --> 08:07.056
[Seven years ago]

08:09.788 --> 08:11.456
Seong Wo,

08:11.456 --> 08:12.957
I'm going to get married.

08:12.957 --> 08:14.667
O Ran is

08:14.667 --> 08:16.461
pregnant.

08:16.461 --> 08:19.005
You punk, you can't even
handle that one thing properly.

08:19.005 --> 08:21.174
And now you think it's time to get married?
What about the operation?

08:21.174 --> 08:23.176
Nothing will change
just because I'm getting married.

08:23.176 --> 08:25.220
Getting revenge on Han Kyung Wook
and finding Bulgae,

08:25.220 --> 08:26.638
I'll handle it all without a hitch.

08:26.638 --> 08:29.474
You punk, you think it's that easy?

08:29.474 --> 08:31.888
What if the day comes when you
have to choose one or the other?

08:31.888 --> 08:33.436
Why are you always so passive?

08:33.436 --> 08:35.897
I'll just do both right.

08:35.897 --> 08:38.384
Ho Myung, do you know
why I never got married?

08:38.384 --> 08:40.059
Isn't it because you couldn't?

08:41.694 --> 08:43.071
I've lived my whole life

08:43.071 --> 08:47.325
thinking family would only
get in the way of the mission.

08:47.325 --> 08:49.577
But I was wrong.

08:49.577 --> 08:52.696
The moment I heard about
the baby from O Ran, I realized.

08:53.331 --> 08:55.449
If it's for your family,

08:56.417 --> 08:58.702
there's nothing you can't do.

09:11.015 --> 09:12.892
Hey, Mr. Yoo!

09:12.892 --> 09:14.102
Are you okay?

09:14.102 --> 09:15.645
Feeling any better?

09:15.645 --> 09:17.814
What the... How'd you know to come here?

09:17.814 --> 09:22.268
Come on. Of course, I had to come see.
My coworker got hurt.

09:23.027 --> 09:24.612
But

09:24.612 --> 09:26.772
this isn't even a private room, huh?

09:30.451 --> 09:32.319
Could you move aside a bit?

09:34.497 --> 09:37.750
What, are you telling the patient to leave?

09:37.750 --> 09:39.888
- Hey!
- Darn it.

09:41.171 --> 09:42.338
Everyone, get out.

09:42.338 --> 09:43.673
Yes, boss.

09:43.673 --> 09:44.674
Everyone out.

09:44.674 --> 09:47.408
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

09:52.348 --> 09:54.717
Wow, wow!

09:56.060 --> 09:59.344
You got beaten up worse than I thought.

09:59.344 --> 10:01.191
Darn it, that punk...

10:01.191 --> 10:03.610
I heard that one guy messed everything up.

10:03.610 --> 10:06.192
The mighty In Goo faction?

10:06.192 --> 10:08.907
Quit sticking your nose into
what goes on at other people's workplaces.

10:08.907 --> 10:10.116
No way!

10:10.116 --> 10:12.660
I also want to ignore it, but you know?

10:12.660 --> 10:16.039
I have to report the Yeongseondo Island
business status to Mr. Han

10:16.039 --> 10:17.248
the day after tomorrow.

10:17.248 --> 10:19.834
Alright, the security office incident
last time was number one,

10:19.834 --> 10:22.462
and this one's number two.

10:22.462 --> 10:24.547
Trouble keeps happening on the Capital side,

10:24.547 --> 10:27.091
so I'm having a hard time deciding

10:27.091 --> 10:29.168
what kind of stance to take, okay?

10:30.553 --> 10:31.804
Chairman Do.

10:31.804 --> 10:34.766
Do I look incapable of handling
something this small?

10:34.766 --> 10:37.101
Watch your mouth.

10:37.101 --> 10:39.896
Keep running it carelessly

10:39.896 --> 10:41.597
and you'll get killed.

10:45.693 --> 10:48.655
I know, I know.

10:48.655 --> 10:51.616
I know exactly how capable you are, Mr. Yoo.

10:51.616 --> 10:53.785
That's why we're on the same boat.

10:53.785 --> 10:56.412
As long as this business

10:56.412 --> 10:59.791
goes well, no problem.

10:59.791 --> 11:01.617
No problem.

11:02.502 --> 11:06.339
Oh, vitamin, please.

11:06.339 --> 11:10.218
Make sure you take your vitamins

11:10.218 --> 11:11.261
and get better soon.

11:11.261 --> 11:13.388
Getting better, goodbye!

11:13.388 --> 11:14.681
Oh!

11:14.681 --> 11:17.433
We'll talk business next time.

11:17.433 --> 11:19.060
Bye.

11:19.060 --> 11:20.761
See you!

11:24.776 --> 11:25.867
Jeez!

11:25.867 --> 11:27.568
Boss!

11:28.245 --> 11:29.245
What's wrong, boss? What?

11:29.245 --> 11:31.289
What's going on?

11:31.289 --> 11:33.041
Go get that masked punk.

11:33.041 --> 11:34.876
- What?
- Uh, boss,

11:34.876 --> 11:38.118
how are we supposed to find a guy
we don't even know?

11:38.118 --> 11:40.454
You idiot, isn't it obvious?

11:40.454 --> 11:42.331
The guy who single-handedly
destroyed our In Goo faction.

11:42.331 --> 11:44.166
Who would have a grudge against us?

11:44.166 --> 11:46.251
The martial arts master who lost
his house deed and got beaten by us.

11:46.251 --> 11:47.336
Who else could it be but that punk?

11:47.336 --> 11:48.796
But the fighting styles
of that martial arts guy

11:48.796 --> 11:50.248
and the masked guy felt different, right?

11:50.248 --> 11:51.272
- Yes.
- Yes.

11:51.272 --> 11:54.301
Forget the "fighting style" crap
and bring him to me!

11:54.301 --> 11:55.803
- Once we rough him up,
- We're on it!

11:55.803 --> 11:57.971
we'll know!

11:57.971 --> 11:59.208
We'll bring him in.

11:59.208 --> 12:01.384
Ugh, darn it!

12:03.784 --> 12:07.528
[Police Station]

12:15.322 --> 12:16.949
Yes.

12:16.949 --> 12:18.325
Did you look into everything I mentioned?

12:18.325 --> 12:19.368
Yes.

12:19.368 --> 12:21.370
The most important thing

12:21.370 --> 12:23.122
[Chief Kwon Sun Bok Assassination Report]
is on page three.

12:23.122 --> 12:24.832
Okay.

12:24.832 --> 12:27.334
[Organization Structure]
Hwasan faction structure from ten years ago.

12:27.334 --> 12:29.128
Back then, the boss Hwang Hwa San

12:29.128 --> 12:31.380
was sentenced to life for ordering
Chief Kwon Sun Bok's murder,

12:31.380 --> 12:33.590
and after the organization collapsed,

12:33.590 --> 12:35.144
[No 2. Kang Beom Ryong]
Kang Beom Ryong, the second-in-command,

12:35.144 --> 12:36.468
suddenly disappeared.

12:36.468 --> 12:38.011
Was he reported missing?

12:38.011 --> 12:39.221
Well... not exactly.

12:39.221 --> 12:42.182
Anyway, there hasn't been
any notable activity from him since then.

12:42.182 --> 12:43.767
So naturally,

12:43.767 --> 12:45.644
[No 3. Yoo In Goo]
the former number three, Yoo In Goo,

12:45.644 --> 12:48.063
ended up taking over
the entire Hwasan faction.

12:48.063 --> 12:51.108
He even changed the gang's name
from Hwasan faction to In Goo faction

12:51.108 --> 12:53.360
and expanded their power even further.

12:53.360 --> 12:55.737
[No 3. Yoo In Goo]
Yoo In Goo?

12:55.737 --> 12:56.989
His whereabouts are known, right?

12:56.989 --> 12:59.732
Yes, look at the last page here.

13:00.743 --> 13:02.828
[Loan Business Registration]
His most recent known activity was

13:02.828 --> 13:06.039
registering a money lending business
called Heaven Capital inside Heaven Casino

13:06.039 --> 13:07.332
on Yeongseondo Island.

13:07.332 --> 13:08.792
Wait a second.

13:08.792 --> 13:10.127
Yeongseondo Island, you said?

13:10.127 --> 13:12.829
Yes, is there any problem?

13:16.136 --> 13:18.056
[Yeongseondo Island]

13:20.762 --> 13:23.348
Yeongseondo Island?

13:23.348 --> 13:24.475
So?

13:24.475 --> 13:26.310
You came back empty-handed?

13:26.310 --> 13:29.188
See? I told you not to act alone, didn't I?

13:29.188 --> 13:32.566
Seong Wo, that jerky factory
seemed suspicious, right?

13:32.566 --> 13:33.859
Maybe we should search the place...

13:33.859 --> 13:34.860
Again, again!

13:34.860 --> 13:36.153
Absolutely not, don't go there alone.

13:36.153 --> 13:37.321
Why not?

13:37.321 --> 13:38.440
I'll handle it myself.

13:38.440 --> 13:39.531
Ho Myung.

13:39.531 --> 13:40.991
You're not the old Jeong Ho Myung anymore.

13:40.991 --> 13:43.577
Face reality already!

13:43.577 --> 13:46.413
What are you gonna tell
your family if you get hurt?

13:46.413 --> 13:48.832
You remember Prosecutor Kang
I mentioned before?

13:48.832 --> 13:51.168
A little more and I think
we can fully tie her in.

13:51.168 --> 13:52.920
Until then, stay put

13:52.920 --> 13:55.288
and try scoring some points with your wife.

13:56.298 --> 13:58.425
What's wrong with you all of a sudden?

13:58.425 --> 14:00.093
This isn't some marriage counseling session.

14:00.093 --> 14:02.930
Man, I just hate seeing you
looking so darn miserable.

14:02.930 --> 14:05.173
Didn't you say you could handle both?

14:07.851 --> 14:09.478
Then just stay on standby, okay?

14:09.478 --> 14:11.480
[Samsung Printing Advertising Planning]
Never act alone, got it?

14:11.480 --> 14:13.032
Gotta go.

14:27.720 --> 14:29.000
Oh.

14:29.000 --> 14:30.332
Did you find anything?

14:30.332 --> 14:32.167
Yes.

14:32.167 --> 14:33.585
It looks like Mr. Yoo's men

14:33.585 --> 14:37.714
are urgently trying to find
the masked attacker right now.

14:37.714 --> 14:38.882
People are saying he might be the same guy

14:38.882 --> 14:41.218
who caused trouble
in the security office incident.

14:41.218 --> 14:43.136
Either way, he doesn't seem ordinary.

14:43.136 --> 14:45.013
He's the one who single-handedly
swept away the In Goo faction.

14:45.013 --> 14:46.807
How could he be ordinary?

14:46.807 --> 14:49.810
Please keep a close eye
on that matter and follow up on it.

14:49.810 --> 14:51.144
- Got it.
- Oh,

14:51.144 --> 14:53.689
and the jerky business I mentioned before,
did you look into it?

14:53.689 --> 14:55.691
They're disguising drugs imported from China

14:55.691 --> 14:57.859
as jerky and distributing them.

14:57.859 --> 14:59.194
Besides our casino,

14:59.194 --> 15:03.532
they've built a pretty solid
distribution network nationwide.

15:03.532 --> 15:05.441
Jeez.

15:06.201 --> 15:09.570
Let's see. The monthly
distribution volume is...

15:10.536 --> 15:12.165
[Estimated Distribution (Monthly) 50kg]

15:12.165 --> 15:14.918
Fifty kilograms? Wow!

15:14.918 --> 15:16.503
[Estimated Monthly Revenue (KRW)]
That revenue is

15:16.503 --> 15:19.006
[15,000,000,000 KRW]
one, ten, hundred, thousand...

15:19.006 --> 15:20.707
15 billion won?

15:20.707 --> 15:22.634
Wow.

15:22.634 --> 15:25.095
Wow, Yoo In Goo!

15:25.095 --> 15:27.723
He's got a much better head
for business than he looks.

15:27.723 --> 15:30.934
He built himself quite the cash cow.

15:30.934 --> 15:32.603
What should we do?

15:32.603 --> 15:35.606
If we connect this jerky business
to our casino,

15:35.606 --> 15:37.774
the synergy could be huge.

15:37.774 --> 15:40.152
If we spread it through the VIP rooms,
we would be quite profitable.

15:40.152 --> 15:41.653
I don't see

15:41.653 --> 15:43.688
any reason to pass this up.

15:46.658 --> 15:48.118
Let's see.

15:48.118 --> 15:50.537
Then, if we just get rid of Mr. Yoo,

15:50.537 --> 15:52.780
everything will be perfect.

15:54.082 --> 15:56.627
But doing this openly

15:56.627 --> 15:58.754
feels a bit risky.

15:58.754 --> 16:00.072
Do you have a plan?

16:00.072 --> 16:02.047
"The enemy's gate is down,

16:02.047 --> 16:04.551
but only from the inside."

16:04.551 --> 16:06.845
What do you mean by that?

16:06.845 --> 16:10.307
"The enemy's gate can only be opened
from inside the castle."

16:10.307 --> 16:12.768
Let's recruit a gatekeeper
who'll swing it wide open

16:12.768 --> 16:14.635
for us.

16:20.520 --> 16:22.954
Darn it.

16:24.946 --> 16:26.365
Did you find anything?

16:26.365 --> 16:29.064
Boss, I think he already skipped town.

16:29.064 --> 16:31.720
Ugh, it sure looks like it. Darn it.

16:31.720 --> 16:34.414
Where do we even find this punk now?

16:34.414 --> 16:37.167
- Boss, take a look at this!
- What is it?

16:37.167 --> 16:38.669
[Pay slip]
That martial arts master back then

16:38.669 --> 16:41.421
said he works at a company, right?

16:41.421 --> 16:44.383
I'm just a regular office worker.

16:44.383 --> 16:45.717
Just

16:45.717 --> 16:47.418
a regular office worker.

16:48.762 --> 16:51.306
Wow, what a clever guy.

16:51.306 --> 16:54.142
Trace this company address right now, hurry.

16:54.142 --> 16:55.352
- Got it, boss.
- Let's go!

16:55.352 --> 16:57.104
Guys, let's move!

16:57.104 --> 16:59.305
Yes, let's move!

17:04.986 --> 17:07.572
You know the figurine we bought
is a secret from Mom, right?

17:07.572 --> 17:08.949
I know.

17:08.949 --> 17:11.317
Dad, keep it a secret too.

17:14.162 --> 17:16.164
I'm sorry about yesterday.

17:16.164 --> 17:18.375
For making you walk home alone, Ji Woo.

17:18.375 --> 17:19.626
But Dad,

17:19.626 --> 17:21.503
why didn't you come yesterday?

17:21.503 --> 17:23.913
Did you have too many deliveries?

17:32.848 --> 17:35.016
Well...

17:35.016 --> 17:37.769
Even the Masked Racer that you like

17:37.769 --> 17:40.596
has to go immediately when dispatched, right?

17:41.481 --> 17:43.108
I also had

17:43.108 --> 17:45.569
dispatch orders yesterday.

17:45.569 --> 17:49.865
So you went to beat up the bad guys too?

17:49.865 --> 17:52.817
Whoa, that's so cool!

17:53.994 --> 17:55.704
This is also a secret from Mom, okay?

17:55.704 --> 17:57.164
Why?

17:57.164 --> 18:00.000
Just tell Mom you were called out.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.960
Mom was really mad.

18:01.960 --> 18:02.961
Really?

18:02.961 --> 18:05.213
Grandpa says

18:05.213 --> 18:08.207
it won't blow over easily this time.

18:10.927 --> 18:14.181
Dad, I asked I Seo,

18:14.181 --> 18:17.768
and she said there's a way to calm Mom down.

18:17.768 --> 18:19.478
What is it?

18:19.478 --> 18:21.188
She said no matter how angry Mom gets,

18:21.188 --> 18:23.482
if you compliment her, buy her gifts,

18:23.482 --> 18:25.567
and go on dates, she'll forgive you.

18:25.567 --> 18:27.778
- A date?
- Dad.

18:27.778 --> 18:29.687
Can you see over there?

18:31.880 --> 18:33.576
[Masked Racer's Great Adventure]

18:40.415 --> 18:42.116
Ugh, my back...

18:45.712 --> 18:48.539
Seriously, where did this idiot
disappear to now?

18:57.599 --> 18:59.967
Yeongseon Food?

19:03.464 --> 19:05.064
[Yeongseon Food]

19:05.832 --> 19:07.150
- Let's go, boys!
- Come on!

19:07.150 --> 19:08.443
- Grab him!
- Grab him!

19:08.443 --> 19:09.694
What do you think you're doing?

19:09.694 --> 19:11.196
Get inside!

19:11.196 --> 19:12.239
These people...

19:12.239 --> 19:13.240
Oh, excuse me!

19:13.240 --> 19:15.200
Hold on, hold on!

19:15.200 --> 19:16.493
It's okay. Come here.

19:16.493 --> 19:17.869
- Come over here for a second.
- Me?

19:17.869 --> 19:20.121
It's okay.

19:20.121 --> 19:22.040
It's okay.

19:22.040 --> 19:23.792
Come here.

19:23.792 --> 19:25.460
I just wanna ask you something.

19:25.460 --> 19:27.295
- Uh, sure.
- Huh?

19:27.295 --> 19:31.842
That guy Bong Jae Soon or whatever,
he works here, right?

19:31.842 --> 19:33.960
Where could this guy be?

19:33.960 --> 19:35.303
[Pay slip]

19:35.303 --> 19:36.930
You mean Mr. Bong?

19:36.930 --> 19:39.340
Yeah, Mr. Bong, Mr. Bong.

19:40.183 --> 19:42.894
Where is he? You don't know?

19:42.894 --> 19:45.689
He should be in the second factory building
around this time.

19:45.689 --> 19:48.233
Second factory building? Where?

19:48.233 --> 19:49.934
Over there.

19:51.111 --> 19:52.195
Hey, it's the second floor!

19:52.195 --> 19:53.864
- Hurry up!
- Okay, okay.

19:53.864 --> 19:56.107
Hey, hey! Second floor!

20:00.287 --> 20:01.988
Run quickly.

20:10.380 --> 20:12.081
Mr. Bong!

20:17.430 --> 20:18.430
Ugh, Mr. Bong!

20:18.430 --> 20:19.806
What are you doing here right now?

20:19.806 --> 20:21.600
They said the restroom was too filthy, so...

20:21.600 --> 20:22.893
That's not the issue right now!

20:22.893 --> 20:25.562
There are gangsters outside!

20:25.562 --> 20:28.064
Gangsters came to catch you, Mr. Bong!

20:28.064 --> 20:29.765
Nam Il...

20:38.575 --> 20:40.035
- What?
- Oh, you scared me.

20:40.035 --> 20:41.703
- What's wrong with him?
- Where's he going?

20:41.703 --> 20:43.446
What's wrong with him?

20:44.122 --> 20:45.415
Nam Il, wake up, wake up!

20:45.415 --> 20:46.625
What's up, Uncle?

20:46.625 --> 20:48.752
- You're off work already?
- The gangsters are here. Gangsters!

20:48.752 --> 20:50.086
Quickly, get up!

20:50.086 --> 20:51.254
Gangsters?

20:51.254 --> 20:53.331
Mr. Bong, what are you doing?

20:54.132 --> 20:56.384
What is this?

20:56.384 --> 20:59.095
I'm sorry, sir. I'll explain later.

20:59.095 --> 21:01.556
- I'm sorry, sir!
- No, explain now.

21:01.556 --> 21:03.808
Sir, I'll explain later.

21:03.808 --> 21:04.851
What's going on?

21:04.851 --> 21:06.802
Grab Mr. Bong!

21:11.024 --> 21:12.725
Jeez.

21:17.906 --> 21:19.857
Get on quickly!

21:26.998 --> 21:28.991
- Over there!
- Yes!

21:33.755 --> 21:36.092
Everyone, come out!

21:36.092 --> 21:37.092
Hey, hey, hey!

21:37.092 --> 21:38.120
Stop, stop, stop!

21:38.120 --> 21:39.135
Stop, you punk!

21:39.135 --> 21:40.220
Hey, that punk is over there!

21:40.220 --> 21:41.256
Catch him quickly!

21:41.256 --> 21:43.098
Run fast. Run, run!

21:43.098 --> 21:45.424
- Quickly, quickly!
- Catch him over there!

21:46.101 --> 21:47.760
Ugh, it hurts.

21:48.520 --> 21:49.567
Oh, my.

21:49.567 --> 21:51.398
Ouch!

21:51.398 --> 21:52.691
- I'm going.
- Hey!

21:52.691 --> 21:54.600
Stop! Freeze right there!

21:55.485 --> 21:57.353
Oh, hold on! Oh...

22:02.243 --> 22:03.243
Hey!

22:03.243 --> 22:04.244
What's going on?

22:04.244 --> 22:05.912
Ah, darn it!

22:05.912 --> 22:07.863
- Jeez.
- Catch him!

22:08.832 --> 22:09.916
Huh?

22:09.916 --> 22:11.208
What? What?

22:11.208 --> 22:12.585
- Goodness!
- Oh, my.

22:12.585 --> 22:13.586
Sir...

22:13.586 --> 22:14.754
Ben... Ben Soon...

22:14.754 --> 22:16.548
Ben Soon, no!

22:16.548 --> 22:18.216
Ah, no!

22:18.216 --> 22:20.072
Ben Soon!

22:20.072 --> 22:22.554
[Win-Win Bank]

22:22.554 --> 22:24.514
How many times do I have to tell you?

22:24.514 --> 22:25.890
Please show me your ID.

22:25.890 --> 22:28.435
I crossed on a yellow light!

22:28.435 --> 22:29.561
Are you blind?

22:29.561 --> 22:30.687
Please show me your ID.

22:30.687 --> 22:32.388
Seriously...

22:45.994 --> 22:47.695
Here it is.

22:50.040 --> 22:52.742
What a nasty piece of work.

23:13.396 --> 23:15.482
- Darn it, you startled me!
- Y-You startled me!

23:15.482 --> 23:17.067
Oh, I'm sorry.

23:17.067 --> 23:19.736
You were standing in the rain.

23:19.736 --> 23:21.863
Oh, it was you, sir.

23:21.863 --> 23:24.532
But do you really patrol
even in weather like this?

23:24.532 --> 23:25.867
Yeah, well, that's the job.

23:25.867 --> 23:28.119
Here, use this.

23:28.119 --> 23:30.497
- What about you?
- I can just take the bus.

23:30.497 --> 23:31.956
The convenience store's
right nearby when I get off.

23:31.956 --> 23:35.001
If you stay in the rain too long,
you'll catch a cold. I'll get going.

23:35.001 --> 23:36.702
Oh, wait...

23:38.463 --> 23:39.547
Oh, hold on!

23:39.547 --> 23:40.632
Stop, stop!

23:40.632 --> 23:42.759
Hey, sir, stop!

23:42.759 --> 23:44.219
Ah, stop!

23:44.219 --> 23:46.387
Please, just stop already!

23:46.387 --> 23:48.756
Stop! Stop!

24:00.318 --> 24:01.653
Get in.

24:01.653 --> 24:04.188
I'm heading that way anyway.
I'll give you a ride.

24:05.281 --> 24:07.117
Oh, it's nothing.

24:07.117 --> 24:08.910
It's cool and refreshing. It's fine.

24:08.910 --> 24:12.247
You know the buses only come
once an hour here, right?

24:12.247 --> 24:14.073
Get in.

24:14.791 --> 24:16.084
I've gotten all wet.

24:16.084 --> 24:20.213
You said standing in the rain
too long gives you a cold.

24:20.213 --> 24:21.914
It's fine.

24:28.346 --> 24:30.348
Sir,

24:30.348 --> 24:32.350
you like Chow Yun Fat, don't you?

24:32.350 --> 24:34.477
No way. How'd you know that?

24:34.477 --> 24:37.689
Well, you came up
in the friend recommendations on Talk.

24:37.689 --> 24:39.315
Your profile pic is Chow Yun Fat, right?

24:39.315 --> 24:42.110
I'm a fan of Chow Yun Fat too,
so I just thought I'd mention it.

24:42.110 --> 24:45.280
Wow, really? Oh, I see.

24:45.280 --> 24:47.356
But what's a "profile pic"?

24:48.408 --> 24:50.160
Profile picture.

24:50.160 --> 24:52.537
Oh, the picture!

24:52.537 --> 24:53.746
Anyway, "A Better Tomorrow."

24:53.746 --> 24:56.958
I really loved watching that movie on VHS.

24:56.958 --> 24:58.376
Ah, yes.

24:58.376 --> 25:00.587
"A Better Tomorrow" on VHS

25:00.587 --> 25:03.423
is truly a masterpiece. Well...

25:03.423 --> 25:05.341
Then did you know

25:05.341 --> 25:08.178
it's getting re-released

25:08.178 --> 25:09.471
for its 40th anniversary this week?

25:09.471 --> 25:10.471
Of course!

25:10.471 --> 25:12.098
"A Better Tomorrow" is

25:12.098 --> 25:13.892
way too good

25:13.892 --> 25:16.186
to watch on a tiny screen.

25:16.186 --> 25:17.687
So...

25:17.687 --> 25:18.771
maybe this time,

25:18.771 --> 25:22.150
how about seeing it in theaters?

25:22.150 --> 25:24.402
Oh...

25:24.402 --> 25:26.529
I would like to do that too,

25:26.529 --> 25:28.781
but I don't really like

25:28.781 --> 25:31.284
going to theaters alone,

25:31.284 --> 25:35.279
and I don't really have anyone to go with.

25:37.248 --> 25:39.459
Oh, I see.

25:39.459 --> 25:41.577
Oh dear, what should you do about that?

25:42.921 --> 25:45.173
Then this time,

25:45.173 --> 25:47.666
try go to

25:48.511 --> 25:49.511
the movies...

25:49.511 --> 25:50.929
A solo cinema challenge!

25:50.929 --> 25:52.013
How about trying things like this?

25:52.013 --> 25:53.348
Nowadays, people are doing
solo dining challenges and such.

25:53.348 --> 25:55.674
There's been a lot of it since COVID.

25:57.061 --> 25:58.061
Watching movies alone?

25:58.061 --> 25:59.646
Yes, a lot of young folks do it.

25:59.646 --> 26:02.398
Watching alone... yeah, that's fine.

26:02.398 --> 26:04.776
- Challenge!
- Challenge! Cool.

26:04.776 --> 26:06.477
Seriously...

26:21.709 --> 26:23.711
T-Thank you.

26:23.711 --> 26:24.963
Thanks to you, I got here safely.

26:24.963 --> 26:26.631
You should get going. You must be busy.

26:26.631 --> 26:28.675
Here.

26:28.675 --> 26:31.302
- Excuse me, sir.
- Yes?

26:31.302 --> 26:33.930
When are you going to watch

26:33.930 --> 26:35.807
"A Better Tomorrow"?

26:35.807 --> 26:38.184
Since it premieres the day after tomorrow,

26:38.184 --> 26:40.228
- on its premiere day...
- Really?

26:40.228 --> 26:42.188
- Yes.
- It just so happens

26:42.188 --> 26:44.181
that I'm off the day after tomorrow.

26:44.983 --> 26:48.018
Oh, I see.

26:49.988 --> 26:53.190
Do police work two shifts or three shifts?

27:02.458 --> 27:03.835
Would you like to go together?

27:03.835 --> 27:05.536
Go where?

27:07.005 --> 27:08.673
To the movies.

27:08.673 --> 27:10.133
"A Better Tomorrow."

27:10.133 --> 27:12.334
Let's go watch it together.

27:16.431 --> 27:18.382
- You don't want to?
- That's not it.

27:21.853 --> 27:23.313
I would love to.

27:23.313 --> 27:25.523
Then I'll text you the details later.

27:25.523 --> 27:26.941
Okay.

27:26.941 --> 27:28.934
- Contact me.
- Yeah.

27:43.291 --> 27:44.992
It doesn't hurt.

27:50.256 --> 27:52.124
- Get over here.
- Yes.

27:55.303 --> 27:56.387
Are you okay?

27:56.387 --> 27:57.889
Boss, really...

27:57.889 --> 27:59.640
We're deploying everyone we have to find him,

27:59.640 --> 28:01.184
so if you give me a little more time...

28:01.184 --> 28:02.185
You punk!

28:02.185 --> 28:04.729
The fate of our organization is tied to
the deal happening the day after tomorrow.

28:04.729 --> 28:05.897
More time?

28:05.897 --> 28:08.358
What if that martial arts freak
shows up again and ruins everything?

28:08.358 --> 28:10.485
We don't even know what he's after!

28:10.485 --> 28:12.853
How can we proceed with the deal confidently?

28:13.738 --> 28:15.406
B-Boss, please don't do this.

28:15.406 --> 28:18.888
If we could push the deal date back a little,
wouldn't that be better?

28:22.038 --> 28:23.623
You know how much the advance payment was!

28:23.623 --> 28:25.291
How can you talk nonsense right now?

28:25.291 --> 28:27.543
If this deal falls through and we go broke,

28:27.543 --> 28:28.711
are you going to take responsibility?

28:28.711 --> 28:29.921
I'm sorry.

28:29.921 --> 28:31.798
We'll proceed with the deal no matter what.

28:31.798 --> 28:33.257
Before that, catch that martial arts master,

28:33.257 --> 28:35.635
- and drag him in front of me.
- Understood, sir.

28:35.635 --> 28:36.928
Drag him here!

28:36.928 --> 28:40.047
- Hurry, drag him over here quickly!
- Yes, yes, boss.

28:40.047 --> 28:41.640
We're going.

28:44.136 --> 28:46.929
It really hurts. Darn it!

28:48.398 --> 28:50.724
How long do I have to
keep getting hit like this?

28:55.822 --> 28:58.232
Hey! Mr. Golden Boy!

28:59.033 --> 29:01.035
Ah, Chairman. Hello, sir.

29:01.035 --> 29:03.204
Huh? What's up, man?

29:03.204 --> 29:04.330
Why the long face?

29:04.330 --> 29:06.184
Is something bothering you?

29:06.184 --> 29:08.459
No, no.

29:08.459 --> 29:10.461
Come on, don't be like that.

29:10.461 --> 29:12.130
Actually, if you're feeling restless,

29:12.130 --> 29:14.664
how about a drive with me in this supercar?

29:14.664 --> 29:16.135
Oh, well...

29:16.135 --> 29:17.135
With me?

29:17.135 --> 29:19.429
Yes, it's for you!

29:19.429 --> 29:21.130
Come on!

29:35.570 --> 29:37.229
Oh, I'm sorry.

29:37.947 --> 29:40.450
Let's just think of each other as coworkers,

29:40.450 --> 29:41.993
and be comfortable with it, okay?

29:41.993 --> 29:44.328
Here, have some coffee.

29:44.328 --> 29:45.329
Yeah, yeah.

29:45.329 --> 29:47.030
Take it easy.

29:50.710 --> 29:52.378
You've had a hard time working
under Mr. Yoo, haven't you?

29:52.378 --> 29:53.546
No, not at all.

29:53.546 --> 29:55.756
Oh, come on.

29:55.756 --> 29:58.301
But considering how hard you're working,

29:58.301 --> 29:59.427
it seems like you're not being treated well.

29:59.427 --> 30:01.920
- You look pretty worn out.
- Well...

30:03.724 --> 30:04.724
If it were me,

30:04.724 --> 30:07.226
I could offer a much better deal

30:07.226 --> 30:10.637
to someone as excellent as you, Mr. Gold.

30:12.899 --> 30:14.192
I have

30:14.192 --> 30:16.727
no intention of betraying my boss.

30:19.155 --> 30:20.615
Oh, I shouldn't have said that.

30:20.615 --> 30:21.616
Alright, alright,

30:21.616 --> 30:23.618
wipe the side of your mouth there.

30:23.618 --> 30:25.319
- Thank you.
- Got coffee there.

30:26.162 --> 30:27.622
I'm not trying to

30:27.622 --> 30:30.708
have some serious talk about betrayal.

30:30.708 --> 30:32.001
I just wanted to talk

30:32.001 --> 30:35.505
about work stress with you, Mr. Gold.

30:35.505 --> 30:38.090
For example, some time ago,

30:38.090 --> 30:40.510
something interesting like that ordinary guy

30:40.510 --> 30:43.221
who recently caused chaos at the Capital,

30:43.221 --> 30:46.516
or Mr. Yoo's secret beef jerky business.

30:46.516 --> 30:49.644
Cool and interesting topics like that.

30:49.644 --> 30:51.062
Okay?

30:51.062 --> 30:53.731
How do you know about that?

30:53.731 --> 30:54.857
Come on.

30:54.857 --> 30:57.693
There's no secret, man.

30:57.693 --> 30:59.394
Pardon?

31:01.155 --> 31:02.856
What did you say?

31:04.660 --> 31:06.744
So, what I'm saying is
there's no secret, you know.

31:06.744 --> 31:07.944
Oh, no secret...

31:15.878 --> 31:17.838
The story you shared with me today.

31:17.838 --> 31:19.840
How should I put it? It was...

31:19.840 --> 31:21.592
Very touching.

31:21.592 --> 31:24.044
- Yeah.
- Let's meet again.

31:31.061 --> 31:32.061
What?

31:32.061 --> 31:34.313
It's a gift from the Chairman.

31:34.313 --> 31:36.014
A gift?

31:42.238 --> 31:44.231
Thank you, Chairman!

31:50.376 --> 31:51.706
Oh, dear.

31:51.706 --> 31:52.957
Oh, hello, ma'am.

31:52.957 --> 31:53.958
Welcome!

31:53.958 --> 31:55.459
You're out late campaigning today, I see.

31:55.459 --> 31:57.753
- Yeah.
- You're a bit late today, aren't you?

31:57.753 --> 31:59.714
Yeah, that's right.

31:59.714 --> 32:01.674
One specialty and a soju, please.

32:01.674 --> 32:02.925
I'll bring it right out.

32:02.925 --> 32:05.002
- Hold on.
- Yeah.

32:10.152 --> 32:12.180
Oh, dear.

32:17.857 --> 32:18.899
Well...

32:18.899 --> 32:20.818
What brings you here, Assemblyman Han?

32:20.818 --> 32:24.030
I heard it's a restaurant that
you are said to visit

32:24.030 --> 32:25.197
every single day,

32:25.197 --> 32:26.699
so I came to check it out.

32:26.699 --> 32:29.535
Oh, do I make you uncomfortable?

32:29.535 --> 32:32.288
No, no, not at all.

32:32.288 --> 32:34.749
- Please have a seat.
- Yes.

32:34.749 --> 32:37.084
The rice soup here is absolutely amazing.

32:37.084 --> 32:38.910
Please try it.

32:49.764 --> 32:51.390
Oh.

32:51.390 --> 32:53.091
Let me pour you a drink.

32:53.768 --> 32:55.269
Oh, yes.

32:55.269 --> 32:56.970
Here.

33:00.941 --> 33:02.642
Let me pour you a drink too.

33:06.781 --> 33:09.325
Oh, I'm sorry.

33:09.325 --> 33:12.912
As I end up doing this election campaign,
something that was never meant for me...

33:12.912 --> 33:15.623
When I went out on my first campaign rally,

33:15.623 --> 33:17.375
I shook so many hands

33:17.375 --> 33:19.085
that my hand ended up all blistered.

33:19.085 --> 33:21.337
Oh, is that so?

33:21.337 --> 33:23.964
I shook hands all day,
and my arm felt like it would fall off.

33:23.964 --> 33:26.592
I smiled so much my face cramped,

33:26.592 --> 33:29.679
and my voice went hoarse from speaking.

33:29.679 --> 33:32.598
I just couldn't help but regret it.

33:32.598 --> 33:34.016
"Did I

33:34.016 --> 33:36.593
run for election just for this?"

33:37.645 --> 33:39.647
What about you, Mr. Kim?

33:39.647 --> 33:41.399
Don't you regret

33:41.399 --> 33:43.517
running in this election?

33:44.652 --> 33:48.406
A lifelong educator like you
must be finding it difficult

33:48.406 --> 33:51.033
to wear the politician's clothes,

33:51.033 --> 33:53.869
which don't really suit your nature.

33:53.869 --> 33:55.413
If, by chance,

33:55.413 --> 33:58.040
you could achieve what you want

33:58.040 --> 34:00.876
without becoming the mayor,

34:00.876 --> 34:03.954
would you still continue this election?

34:09.093 --> 34:11.962
What exactly are you trying to say?

34:24.522 --> 34:27.048
[Yeongseon Ja Ae-won Orphanage
Support Project Proposal]

34:31.646 --> 34:33.864
[Han Kyung Wook's Office]

34:37.413 --> 34:39.540
If you step down,

34:39.540 --> 34:41.292
the children
at the Yeongseondo Island orphanage

34:41.292 --> 34:43.002
you care so deeply about

34:43.002 --> 34:45.171
will also receive benefits.

34:45.171 --> 34:46.881
I heard your funding

34:46.881 --> 34:49.925
hasn't even been enough
to fix the heating and cooling,

34:49.925 --> 34:52.928
but it's still entirely possible
to build a new building.

34:52.928 --> 34:55.264
We're also reviewing support plans

34:55.264 --> 34:57.641
like scholarships so the children

34:57.641 --> 35:00.343
can study whatever they want.

35:04.523 --> 35:06.233
I'm sorry,

35:06.233 --> 35:08.527
but I'll have to pretend I never saw this.

35:08.527 --> 35:10.905
I cannot support children

35:10.905 --> 35:13.732
with money of unclear origin.

35:14.700 --> 35:16.359
Origin?

35:18.704 --> 35:20.998
Money doesn't have a name tag on it.

35:20.998 --> 35:23.876
Even if you donate your entire salary

35:23.876 --> 35:26.545
and volunteer every day,

35:26.545 --> 35:28.339
you still wouldn't be able to

35:28.339 --> 35:30.883
complete even a single line of this plan.

35:30.883 --> 35:33.719
You said you'd make
Yeongseondo Island for the children.

35:33.719 --> 35:35.795
Was it all just empty talk?

35:48.025 --> 35:50.194
You asked me if I regret

35:50.194 --> 35:53.364
running for election, didn't you?

35:53.364 --> 35:54.949
Yes.

35:54.949 --> 35:57.326
Every single day is hard.

35:57.326 --> 35:59.986
Every day, I feel like running away.

36:01.038 --> 36:04.500
I've spent my whole life as a teacher,

36:04.500 --> 36:08.712
so being a politician
doesn't feel like it suits me at all.

36:08.712 --> 36:10.089
But

36:10.089 --> 36:12.207
what's more frightening is

36:13.259 --> 36:16.136
knowing that if you become mayor,

36:16.136 --> 36:20.850
you'll ruin the children
and Yeongseondo Island,

36:20.850 --> 36:23.134
and still choosing to look away.

36:29.775 --> 36:33.362
This will be the last time

36:33.362 --> 36:35.647
I share a drink with you.

36:36.782 --> 36:38.742
Order whatever you'd like to eat.

36:38.742 --> 36:41.287
Since it's the last time, let me pay.

36:41.287 --> 36:42.988
It's alright.

36:45.875 --> 36:47.668
I've eaten well enough.

36:47.668 --> 36:49.369
Then, I'll get going.

36:55.784 --> 36:57.736
[Yeongseon Ja Ae-won Orphanage
Support Project Proposal]

37:09.857 --> 37:11.558
Joong Gi.

37:14.028 --> 37:16.530
We should go volunteer

37:16.530 --> 37:18.690
at the Ja Ae-won Orphanage soon.

37:27.560 --> 37:30.836
If she goes to Yeongseondo Island now,

37:30.836 --> 37:33.038
it'll ruin all our plans.

37:38.385 --> 37:40.346
What do you mean by that, boss?

37:40.346 --> 37:43.432
A prosecutor came to visit me.

37:43.432 --> 37:46.393
At first, I wasn't sure what it was about,

37:46.393 --> 37:50.805
but turns out she's a stubborn one
obsessed with the case.

37:54.610 --> 37:55.694
Beom Ryong.

37:55.694 --> 37:57.988
Go meet that Prosecutor Kang

37:57.988 --> 38:00.023
or whatever.

38:01.158 --> 38:03.577
Are you saying I should help a prosecutor?

38:03.577 --> 38:06.789
Do you think I'd like
working with a prosecutor?

38:06.789 --> 38:08.123
But still,

38:08.123 --> 38:12.294
if it clears my name,
and I can get rid of that traitor Yoo In Goo,

38:12.294 --> 38:14.797
why not love your enemies for once?

38:14.797 --> 38:17.841
I've already set the bait.

38:17.841 --> 38:21.178
So Prosecutor Kang will definitely
approach Yoo In Goo.

38:21.178 --> 38:25.766
You should give that prosecutor
a little help, actively.

38:25.766 --> 38:29.979
And start wrapping up your business.

38:29.979 --> 38:31.271
M-My business?

38:31.271 --> 38:32.815
This might be your last chance.

38:32.815 --> 38:35.192
So you need to give it your all.

38:35.192 --> 38:36.694
You should start gathering the guys for real,

38:36.694 --> 38:38.821
and support Prosecutor Kang or whoever.

38:38.821 --> 38:41.523
You won't have time to run a business.

38:42.409 --> 38:43.409
Why?

38:43.409 --> 38:45.443
Is something bothering you?

39:10.472 --> 39:13.023
[Masked Racer's Great Adventure]

39:13.023 --> 39:14.023
What is this?

39:14.023 --> 39:17.026
You know Ji Woo loves Masked Racer.

39:17.026 --> 39:19.394
There's a show at the arts center.

39:20.279 --> 39:22.772
What about tomorrow night's business?

39:24.074 --> 39:26.368
Since Ji Woo was born, we've been so busy

39:26.368 --> 39:28.704
and haven't really gone out properly
as a family.

39:28.704 --> 39:31.489
Let's get some fresh air and go together.

39:32.458 --> 39:34.334
Just go.

39:34.334 --> 39:36.628
Is the business gonna collapse
if we take a day or two off?

39:36.628 --> 39:39.089
We can just do lunch and close early.

39:39.089 --> 39:40.674
Dad, even one shift off affects sales...

39:40.674 --> 39:42.676
Sales or whatever!

39:42.676 --> 39:44.428
Am I supposed to worry about
my daughter's marriage

39:44.428 --> 39:46.889
while running the business?

39:46.889 --> 39:49.266
Please just go out and settle it

39:49.266 --> 39:51.602
once and for all.

39:51.602 --> 39:55.388
Dad, when did I ever make you feel that way?

39:57.357 --> 39:58.400
Alright, go.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.860
Go, okay?

39:59.860 --> 40:02.562
This is what Ji Woo loves so much.

40:07.701 --> 40:09.703
Assemblyman Han, step down!

40:09.703 --> 40:12.998
Step down, step down, step down!

40:12.998 --> 40:15.000
Chairman Do, step down!

40:15.000 --> 40:18.995
Step down, step down, step down!

40:24.456 --> 40:25.896
Oh, dear.

40:40.936 --> 40:44.437
This is getting serious.

40:58.085 --> 40:59.419
Yes, this is Kang Young Ae.

40:59.419 --> 41:01.547
Please think twice

41:01.547 --> 41:03.832
about going into the hotel now.

41:05.092 --> 41:07.293
Who on earth are you?

41:14.017 --> 41:15.435
Are you stalking me?

41:15.435 --> 41:16.520
No, I'm not stalking you.

41:16.520 --> 41:18.605
I'm just warning you that it's dangerous.

41:18.605 --> 41:21.441
So who exactly are you
to keep throwing warnings at me?

41:21.441 --> 41:22.985
Are you making a spy movie or something?

41:22.985 --> 41:24.319
Prosecutor Kang,

41:24.319 --> 41:28.532
don't you remember how I helped you shake off
that tailing officers last time?

41:28.532 --> 41:30.242
Just trust me this once.

41:30.242 --> 41:31.943
Alright.

41:32.578 --> 41:35.122
If you want to earn my trust,
come to the prosecutor's office.

41:35.122 --> 41:36.874
I'll do a thorough identity check,

41:36.874 --> 41:40.368
and if you're verified, then I'll trust you.

41:42.379 --> 41:44.372
Get off work!

41:56.059 --> 41:57.394
Okay.

41:57.394 --> 42:00.096
Let's just think about this while eating.

42:04.610 --> 42:06.153
Are you seriously eating eggs right now?

42:06.153 --> 42:08.447
Ms. Lee, you're here. Want an egg?

42:08.447 --> 42:09.740
No, thanks.

42:09.740 --> 42:13.026
I salvaged as much as I could
from what the boss wanted to throw away.

42:15.624 --> 42:17.789
Jeez.

42:17.789 --> 42:19.625
Is this all you managed to bring?

42:19.625 --> 42:21.502
Could you be more attentive?

42:21.502 --> 42:23.462
Thanks, thanks, thanks!

42:23.462 --> 42:26.381
When I get back to the company,
I'll cover all your work, Ms. Lee.

42:26.381 --> 42:28.675
Thanks.

42:28.675 --> 42:30.835
That might be a bit difficult.

42:32.012 --> 42:33.430
Mr. Bong,

42:33.430 --> 42:36.883
you've been processed
for resignation effective today.

42:39.686 --> 42:41.438
No way...

42:41.438 --> 42:43.273
Resignation? Why?

42:43.273 --> 42:45.359
Are you asking because you don't know?

42:45.359 --> 42:47.444
You were absent constantly,

42:47.444 --> 42:49.446
staying in the company without permission,

42:49.446 --> 42:51.657
bringing gangsters into the office,
wrecking the boss' car...

42:51.657 --> 42:53.450
I barely settled things

42:53.450 --> 42:55.410
while the boss was making a scene
over trespassing and hit-and-run.

42:55.410 --> 42:56.912
I barely got them to handle it

42:56.912 --> 42:59.873
by terminating your employment
and deducting your severance pay.

42:59.873 --> 43:01.574
So...

43:04.461 --> 43:07.005
Don't take it too unfairly.

43:07.005 --> 43:09.758
What? Did you get fired from the company?

43:09.758 --> 43:12.543
Then, are we completely broke? Huh?

43:15.389 --> 43:17.849
Do you have somewhere to go?

43:17.849 --> 43:19.476
What do you think?

43:19.476 --> 43:22.762
There are gangsters outside glaring fiercely.

43:26.358 --> 43:27.818
Mr. Bong,

43:27.818 --> 43:31.020
is just room and board enough for you?

43:32.823 --> 43:35.951
Well, I can introduce you to a job

43:35.951 --> 43:38.578
that provides room and board.

43:38.578 --> 43:40.414
But I'm not sure if you're good at it...

43:40.414 --> 43:42.833
I'll do it. Yeah, I'll definitely do it.

43:42.833 --> 43:44.876
I'll definitely do it well.

43:44.876 --> 43:46.295
Cleaning? Car wash?

43:46.295 --> 43:48.413
What do I need to do?

43:55.944 --> 43:58.472
[D-Day]

44:03.061 --> 44:05.272
Excuse me.

44:05.272 --> 44:07.056
Yeah, what brings you here?

44:08.275 --> 44:09.768
I'm Prosecutor Kang Young Ae
from Criminal Division 3

44:09.768 --> 44:10.986
at Imcheon District Prosecutor's Office.

44:10.986 --> 44:12.854
I'd like to speak with the owner...

44:13.697 --> 44:14.865
Oh, my.

44:14.865 --> 44:18.443
You must be Mr. Yoo In Goo, right?

44:23.540 --> 44:27.127
What brings a prosecutor to a clean,

44:27.127 --> 44:29.588
legitimate business like ours?

44:29.588 --> 44:31.173
Well,

44:31.173 --> 44:34.593
I'm currently working on a case,

44:34.593 --> 44:36.094
and I have a few questions to ask you.

44:36.094 --> 44:37.795
Oh, yes.

44:43.643 --> 44:46.605
[Two NIS agents missing in ferry operation]
Do you know anything

44:46.605 --> 44:48.482
about the ferry espionage case
from ten years ago?

44:48.482 --> 44:50.067
Well, I'm hearing this for the first time.

44:50.067 --> 44:52.185
Did a spy come down here?

44:53.653 --> 44:55.364
[Kwon Sun Bok murder linked to Hwasan Boss]
Then,

44:55.364 --> 44:56.615
what about this?

44:56.615 --> 44:58.325
Mr. Hwang Hwa San, who you were working with,

44:58.325 --> 45:00.985
was involved in the murder of Kwon Sun Bok.

45:01.745 --> 45:04.039
Well, my memory is a bit hazy on that.

45:04.039 --> 45:06.750
After that, didn't you take over
Hwasan faction and form In Goo faction?

45:06.750 --> 45:09.795
No, we didn't take over.
We became independent.

45:09.795 --> 45:11.713
And whatever the story behind it is,

45:11.713 --> 45:13.423
[Woman found dead in Imcheon Villa]
it's really tragic.

45:13.423 --> 45:17.094
Because I don't watch such news,
I don't really know much.

45:17.094 --> 45:19.888
I wonder if my answer is helpful at all.

45:19.888 --> 45:21.839
Shall we continue anyway?

45:22.808 --> 45:26.052
Then I'll ask just one final question.

45:37.280 --> 45:38.824
You know who this person is, right?

45:38.824 --> 45:40.700
Well, that man is...

45:40.700 --> 45:43.412
Isn't he a candidate
running for mayoral election?

45:43.412 --> 45:46.312
You haven't watched the news, but you seem
to know Han Kyung Wook very well, huh?

45:46.312 --> 45:50.085
Well, I've seen the election posters
here and there a few times.

45:50.085 --> 45:52.370
Let's be honest.

45:53.296 --> 45:55.006
These previous incidents,

45:55.006 --> 45:57.426
and Assemblyman Han Kyung Wook.

45:57.426 --> 45:58.677
You know them all well, don't you?

45:58.677 --> 46:00.846
Are you interrogating me right now?

46:00.846 --> 46:02.431
Who said anything about interrogation?

46:02.431 --> 46:04.757
I'm just asking some questions now.

46:05.600 --> 46:07.102
Alright, I understand.

46:07.102 --> 46:08.728
Anyway, I'll go meet

46:08.728 --> 46:12.357
Assemblyman Han in person
and get the details directly.

46:12.357 --> 46:15.068
Prosecutor, you're going
to meet him directly?

46:15.068 --> 46:16.153
Oh my, why?

46:16.153 --> 46:19.072
Well, anyway, you saw him
on posters here and there.

46:19.072 --> 46:20.115
So it shouldn't matter, right?

46:20.115 --> 46:21.941
No, it doesn't matter.

46:24.744 --> 46:26.445
I see.

46:27.581 --> 46:29.082
Yes, understood.

46:29.082 --> 46:31.001
Oh my, you've been so cooperative.

46:31.001 --> 46:32.752
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

46:32.752 --> 46:34.504
Okay.

46:34.504 --> 46:35.630
Still,

46:35.630 --> 46:38.507
if anything comes to mind...

46:38.507 --> 46:40.480
[Imcheon District Prosecutor's Office,
Kang Young Ae]

46:40.480 --> 46:42.137
- Please contact me.
- Okay.

46:42.137 --> 46:44.347
- Alright, I'll be going now.
- Yes, take care.

46:44.347 --> 46:46.507
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

46:54.608 --> 46:58.195
♪ I don't know the person ♪

46:58.195 --> 47:00.146
How ridiculous.

47:00.146 --> 47:01.992
[Imcheon District Prosecutor's Office,
Kang Young Ae]

47:05.494 --> 47:07.195
Boss.

47:08.830 --> 47:10.165
Is she really a prosecutor?

47:10.165 --> 47:12.700
Why did the prosecutor have to appear now?

47:14.045 --> 47:15.045
Oh, right!

47:15.045 --> 47:16.129
This isn't the time for this.

47:16.129 --> 47:18.673
Send the guys and find out
what that prosecutor is doing!

47:18.673 --> 47:20.374
Oh, okay.

47:59.950 --> 48:04.623
[Officer Park Mi Kyeong]

48:08.974 --> 48:10.559
A prosecutor from
the Criminal Division came by?

48:10.559 --> 48:12.185
Yes.

48:12.185 --> 48:14.854
She was throwing everything
the In Goo faction has done

48:14.854 --> 48:16.565
right in Mr. Yoo's face.

48:16.565 --> 48:19.016
Like she already knew everything.

48:20.110 --> 48:22.153
On top of that,

48:22.153 --> 48:25.156
she kept pressing about whether it's related
to First Deputy Director Han Kyung Wook.

48:25.156 --> 48:26.283
Who?

48:26.283 --> 48:29.327
- Mr. Han?
- Yes.

48:29.327 --> 48:30.787
He was already worried

48:30.787 --> 48:33.665
Mr. Han might hear about the Capital issues,

48:33.665 --> 48:37.335
and now a prosecutor suddenly shows up too.

48:37.335 --> 48:39.504
Boss In Goo is almost not
in his right mind now.

48:39.504 --> 48:43.582
He's cornered and ready to bite
at the slightest touch.

48:45.176 --> 48:48.847
Mr. Yoo is getting more and more problematic.

48:48.847 --> 48:52.675
So, is he just going to
sit back and watch that prosecutor?

48:53.935 --> 48:56.271
No matter how reckless Boss In Goo is,

48:56.271 --> 48:58.440
he surely wouldn't mess with a prosecutor.

48:58.440 --> 49:01.892
One wrong move and your life
could be ruined in an instant.

49:03.987 --> 49:05.572
Right?

49:05.572 --> 49:08.691
Messing with a prosecutor
could completely ruin you.

49:17.834 --> 49:20.045
[Everyone Daily]
Hey!

49:20.045 --> 49:21.254
What are you doing

49:21.254 --> 49:23.840
at someone else's workplace
first thing in the morning?

49:23.840 --> 49:26.292
I need to urgently confirm something.

49:26.969 --> 49:27.969
It looks like

49:27.969 --> 49:29.846
there's a serious issue
with your Capital firm.

49:29.846 --> 49:31.931
What are you up to now?

49:31.931 --> 49:35.435
A prosecutor came by earlier?

49:35.435 --> 49:39.022
Looks like she came sniffing around
the In Goo faction's activities.

49:39.022 --> 49:40.148
How would you even know that?

49:40.148 --> 49:42.442
She came to me directly and asked everything.

49:42.442 --> 49:44.694
I insisted I didn't know anything,
but really,

49:44.694 --> 49:46.760
I was in a tough spot.

49:46.760 --> 49:48.865
With a prosecutor coming in person,

49:48.865 --> 49:51.993
I can't just let something this serious go
without reporting it to Mr. Han.

49:51.993 --> 49:54.904
Try telling Mr. Han,
and you're dead, you punk!

49:56.584 --> 49:58.375
"You punk"?

50:00.919 --> 50:03.505
Yoo In Goo.

50:03.505 --> 50:07.050
Just because I treat you nicely,
do you think I'm a pushover?

50:07.050 --> 50:08.885
Huh?

50:08.885 --> 50:12.055
You dare to threaten me?

50:12.055 --> 50:14.215
You still don't understand the situation?

50:15.183 --> 50:16.810
What did I do?

50:16.810 --> 50:18.853
A prosecutor came. A prosecutor!

50:18.853 --> 50:21.147
Don't you get what that means?

50:21.147 --> 50:22.732
If that prosecutor digs
around Yeongseondo Island,

50:22.732 --> 50:24.984
exposes our entire business, and harms it,

50:24.984 --> 50:27.320
do you think Mr. Han will just sit still?

50:27.320 --> 50:28.738
You for causing this mess,

50:28.738 --> 50:31.574
and me for ignoring it!

50:31.574 --> 50:34.577
We're both going to end up dead
and buried without a trace.

50:34.577 --> 50:36.278
Got it?

50:36.955 --> 50:37.997
Oh.

50:37.997 --> 50:40.166
No, no, maybe I've gone crazy.

50:40.166 --> 50:42.669
First, I'm sorry for getting angry.

50:42.669 --> 50:44.754
This isn't going to work,
so before I get dragged into this,

50:44.754 --> 50:47.298
I think it's right to report this to Mr. Han.

50:47.298 --> 50:48.633
- Chairman Do, Chairman Do!
- Let go.

50:48.633 --> 50:49.759
- Don't touch me, don't touch me.
- No, no.

50:49.759 --> 50:50.969
- I didn't touch you.
- Okay.

50:50.969 --> 50:52.554
- Don't do this, huh?
- Ah, seriously...

50:52.554 --> 50:54.597
That prosecutor...

50:54.597 --> 50:55.765
I-I'll handle her.

50:55.765 --> 50:57.726
J-Just give me time.

50:57.726 --> 50:59.853
Even if you get some time,
what will you do about a prosecutor?

50:59.853 --> 51:01.479
What will you do? It makes no sense.

51:01.479 --> 51:02.605
I've got a plan!

51:02.605 --> 51:04.858
There's a way, I tell you.

51:04.858 --> 51:07.360
You said you trust me, didn't you?

51:07.360 --> 51:10.947
Huh? You said we're in the same boat, right?

51:10.947 --> 51:13.983
Just give me time.
I'll fix it myself, really.

51:15.618 --> 51:17.778
Jesus Christ!

51:20.665 --> 51:22.000
Just one day.

51:22.000 --> 51:23.501
If you can't solve this by tomorrow,

51:23.501 --> 51:26.379
even I can't help you, okay?

51:26.379 --> 51:29.288
- One day?
- One day, okay?

51:29.288 --> 51:30.383
Well...

51:30.383 --> 51:31.718
Mr. Yoo.

51:31.718 --> 51:35.180
Don't keep making me the bad guy, okay?

51:35.180 --> 51:37.098
Yeah.

51:37.098 --> 51:38.183
Just until tomorrow.

51:38.183 --> 51:39.884
Alright.

51:48.456 --> 51:50.945
[Closed for dinner service tonight]

51:50.945 --> 51:53.114
Ji Woo, what's this called?

51:53.114 --> 51:54.115
Masked Racer.

51:54.115 --> 51:57.410
Ah, Masked Racer?

51:57.410 --> 51:59.537
Then, who is this guy?

51:59.537 --> 52:01.238
Monster!

52:02.582 --> 52:06.076
You've got a sharp eye for people.

52:08.087 --> 52:09.923
Mom!

52:09.923 --> 52:11.624
Huh?

52:27.607 --> 52:29.609
Wow!

52:29.609 --> 52:31.945
O Ran still looks nice!

52:31.945 --> 52:33.321
She takes after me,

52:33.321 --> 52:37.033
so she's naturally good-looking, you know.

52:37.033 --> 52:40.569
Mom, you look really pretty today!

52:42.080 --> 52:44.541
I'm just dressed like usual.

52:44.541 --> 52:46.042
If it's too much, should I change?

52:46.042 --> 52:48.127
No need, it looks good on you!

52:48.127 --> 52:50.797
After the show,
let's go somewhere nice to eat.

52:50.797 --> 52:53.049
I've already picked the place.

52:53.049 --> 52:54.425
Let's go.

52:54.425 --> 52:56.219
- Ji Woo, let's go.
- Alright, go have fun, my dear.

52:56.219 --> 52:58.012
Alright, up you go!

52:58.012 --> 52:59.514
- Dad, see you later.
- We'll be back.

52:59.514 --> 53:01.674
- We'll be off now.
- Let's move out!

53:01.674 --> 53:05.864
[Fox Hair Salon]

54:11.176 --> 54:14.216
[Imcheon District Prosecutor's Office,
Kang Young Ae]

54:20.137 --> 54:21.137
Hello?

54:21.137 --> 54:23.097
Prosecutor Kang Young Ae.

54:23.097 --> 54:24.682
Yes, speaking. Who is this?

54:24.682 --> 54:26.935
I used to serve Chairman Hwang Hwa San.

54:26.935 --> 54:28.616
I'm Kang Beom Ryong.

54:28.616 --> 54:29.812
So, Prosecutor,

54:29.812 --> 54:33.149
I heard you intend to
clear our chairman's name.

54:33.149 --> 54:34.776
I want to help you

54:34.776 --> 54:36.852
as much as I can.

54:37.487 --> 54:40.949
How can I trust you, Mr. Kang Beom Ryong?

54:40.949 --> 54:42.575
I was

54:42.575 --> 54:44.693
on that ferry in the espionage case

54:45.536 --> 54:47.497
ten years ago.

54:47.497 --> 54:51.292
I'm fully aware of the full details
of the case you're investigating, Prosecutor.

54:51.292 --> 54:53.127
You really know everything?

54:53.127 --> 54:55.546
I'd like to meet you in person and explain.

54:55.546 --> 54:57.790
Where are you right now?

54:59.384 --> 55:00.510
Yeongseondo Island.

55:00.510 --> 55:01.552
Yeongseondo Island?

55:01.552 --> 55:03.879
Did that punk Yoo In Goo...

55:05.556 --> 55:08.184
Did you already meet

55:08.184 --> 55:10.395
Yes, it wasn't very useful though.

55:10.395 --> 55:13.648
Let's meet somewhere quiet first.

55:13.648 --> 55:15.808
I'll choose the location.

55:19.336 --> 55:21.448
[Imcheon expert for culture and industry,
Candidate No. 2 Han Kyung Wook]

55:30.040 --> 55:31.040
What brings you here?

55:31.040 --> 55:34.877
Well, actually, I came to ask
if I could borrow some money.

55:34.877 --> 55:35.920
Have a seat.

55:35.920 --> 55:37.621
Okay.

55:48.808 --> 55:51.687
[Loan Agreement]

55:51.687 --> 55:52.687
- Sir.
- Yes?

55:52.687 --> 55:54.689
- You've got this wrong here.
- No, no, I didn't make a mistake.

55:54.689 --> 55:55.940
No, you wrote this wrong.

55:55.940 --> 55:58.100
No, I didn't write it wrong.

55:59.652 --> 56:01.529
- 50,000 won?
- Yes, 50,000 won.

56:01.529 --> 56:02.613
5... 50,000 won?

56:02.613 --> 56:05.158
Yes, 50,000 won.
I'm on a roll right now, sir.

56:05.158 --> 56:07.243
If I just catch the flow now,
I'll hit the jackpot.

56:07.243 --> 56:08.327
- Get out!
- No, sir.

56:08.327 --> 56:09.412
- I said get out!
- No!

56:09.412 --> 56:10.621
I really need it...

56:10.621 --> 56:12.206
- Guys, hey!
- It's a real jackpot, jackpot.

56:12.206 --> 56:13.666
- Guys, get him out of here, quickly.
- I've almost hit the jackpot.

56:13.666 --> 56:14.792
Really, right now, the flow is...

56:14.792 --> 56:17.295
- My time has come, I'm telling you!
- Are you kidding?

56:17.295 --> 56:19.255
- No, I... I...
- Hey.

56:19.255 --> 56:21.883
- Just 50,000 won...
- Someone knock some sense into him.

56:21.883 --> 56:23.926
I'm telling you, I'm on a roll right now!

56:23.926 --> 56:26.545
Just 50,000 won, just 50,000 won!

56:37.023 --> 56:39.725
Boss, what should we do?

56:40.693 --> 56:42.686
Where is that prosecutor?

56:43.571 --> 56:45.615
She's going around Yeongseondo Island

56:45.615 --> 56:48.400
digging into the Capital case.

56:49.327 --> 56:51.454
Boss, maybe

56:51.454 --> 56:54.865
push back the drug deal to a later date.

56:55.875 --> 56:58.961
Do you even know how hard it was
to secure that supply chain?

56:58.961 --> 57:01.714
We poured all In Goo faction's money into it.

57:01.714 --> 57:03.424
If the deal falls through, we're bankrupt.

57:03.424 --> 57:07.887
But what if that prosecutor
catches wind of the drugs?

57:07.887 --> 57:11.507
What if things go wrong
and this reaches Mr. Han's ears?

57:12.308 --> 57:14.560
This is a whole different level
compared to martial arts master issues.

57:14.560 --> 57:17.230
There's no turning back, boss.

57:17.230 --> 57:19.023
Anyway,

57:19.023 --> 57:22.068
if the deal collapses,
the Chinese won't stay quiet.

57:22.068 --> 57:24.403
If we don't deal with the prosecutor today,

57:24.403 --> 57:27.698
Chairman Do, that sly fox,
will rat everything out to Mr. Han.

57:27.698 --> 57:30.910
Whether the deal falls apart
or we die by Mr. Han's hand,

57:30.910 --> 57:32.370
it's death either way.

57:32.370 --> 57:34.997
Then what are we supposed to do?

57:34.997 --> 57:36.916
No matter how I think about it,

57:36.916 --> 57:38.992
there's only one way out.

57:42.880 --> 57:45.299
That prosecutor

57:45.299 --> 57:47.501
- must die.
- Pardon?

57:48.970 --> 57:50.429
Boss!

57:50.429 --> 57:52.723
Even so, messing with a prosecutor
will make this way too big.

57:52.723 --> 57:55.434
We can just make her disappear
into the sea without a trace.

57:55.434 --> 57:58.729
We can erase the traces
by bribing Yeongseon Police.

57:58.729 --> 58:00.731
- Still...
- If that prosecutor disappears,

58:00.731 --> 58:01.941
everything's clean, right?

58:01.941 --> 58:04.768
We can deal
with the martial arts master afterward.

58:05.403 --> 58:08.948
Kang Sik, stop talking
and set up your best guys.

58:08.948 --> 58:11.993
Watch the timing and handle it properly.

58:11.993 --> 58:14.486
I knew she'd really cause some trouble.

58:18.728 --> 58:21.640
[Restricted number]

58:23.848 --> 58:25.192
[Restricted number]

58:57.256 --> 59:04.040
[Hillside Cafe]

59:19.769 --> 59:21.979
Yes, she has arrived.

59:21.979 --> 59:24.023
She just went into
Hillside Cafe in Nakwon-ri.

59:24.023 --> 59:25.608
Hillside Cafe?

59:25.608 --> 59:27.434
Hillside Cafe...

59:28.168 --> 59:30.780
[Hillside Cafe]

59:30.780 --> 59:32.481
20 minutes?

59:43.209 --> 59:45.369
Answer the phone.

59:46.921 --> 59:47.922
This is driving me crazy.

59:47.922 --> 59:50.415
[Yeongseon Food]
Why isn't she answering the phone?

59:51.467 --> 59:54.169
Just answer the phone, darn it!

59:54.169 --> 59:56.483
[Yeongseon Food]

01:00:00.200 --> 01:00:03.240
- The subscriber is unavailable...
- Crap.

01:00:42.518 --> 01:00:44.720
I'm really going crazy, jeez.

01:00:57.908 --> 01:01:00.494
Taxi, taxi!

01:01:00.494 --> 01:01:02.195
Sir!

01:01:14.216 --> 01:01:16.043
[Masked Racer]
Now, it's our turn.

01:01:17.596 --> 01:01:19.472
- Want to take a picture with your mom?
- Huh?

01:01:19.472 --> 01:01:21.182
What's wrong with you?

01:01:21.182 --> 01:01:22.391
Ji Woo, what pose are you going to do?

01:01:22.391 --> 01:01:24.268
Uh... like this.

01:01:24.268 --> 01:01:26.645
Okay, let's go, let's go.

01:01:26.645 --> 01:01:28.272
I'll just go to the bathroom for a second.

01:01:28.272 --> 01:01:29.440
- Okay, go ahead.
- Keep taking pictures.

01:01:29.440 --> 01:01:31.776
Let's go, Ji Woo!

01:01:31.776 --> 01:01:34.070
Stand here.

01:01:34.070 --> 01:01:35.613
Wanna strike a pose, kid?

01:01:35.613 --> 01:01:38.908
- Like this?
- Yeah, well done!

01:01:38.908 --> 01:01:41.902
Okay, one, two, three!

01:01:42.984 --> 01:01:44.616
[Restricted number]

01:01:48.417 --> 01:01:49.502
Want to do it one more time, kid?

01:01:49.502 --> 01:01:52.380
Sorry, I took it wrong.

01:01:52.380 --> 01:01:54.340
What is it, why did you call?
And with a regular phone?

01:01:54.340 --> 01:01:55.925
Ho Myung, it's an emergency!

01:01:55.925 --> 01:01:57.009
Get over here right now.

01:01:57.009 --> 01:01:58.052
What are you talking about? I can't.

01:01:58.052 --> 01:02:00.262
I'm here watching a show with my family now.

01:02:00.262 --> 01:02:01.806
The Yoo In Goo gang

01:02:01.806 --> 01:02:04.517
is going to take out Prosecutor Kang.

01:02:04.517 --> 01:02:06.060
What?

01:02:06.060 --> 01:02:07.978
- Seong Wo, where are you now?
- I'm on Yeongseondo Island.

01:02:07.978 --> 01:02:10.064
Prosecutor Kang is
on Yeongseondo Island right now?

01:02:10.064 --> 01:02:11.482
Yeah.

01:02:11.482 --> 01:02:13.234
Prosecutor Kang

01:02:13.234 --> 01:02:16.737
provoked Yoo In Goo, but this crazy guy...

01:02:16.737 --> 01:02:18.030
There's no time to explain now.

01:02:18.030 --> 01:02:20.783
Get over here quickly, hurry!

01:02:20.783 --> 01:02:22.118
I'm going crazy.

01:02:22.118 --> 01:02:25.237
If you do nothing,
Prosecutor Kang is going to die, man.

01:02:27.623 --> 01:02:28.958
But what's up with your voice?

01:02:28.958 --> 01:02:30.501
No, no, it's fine, it's fine.

01:02:30.501 --> 01:02:33.212
I got hurt a bit. Get here, quickly!

01:02:33.212 --> 01:02:36.006
If anything happens
to Prosecutor Kang, it's all over.

01:02:36.006 --> 01:02:38.166
Ho Myung, hurry up and come.

01:02:41.720 --> 01:02:43.797
Got it, I'll call you back.

01:02:47.017 --> 01:02:48.718
Dad,

01:02:49.437 --> 01:02:52.013
do you have to go on a mission?

01:02:54.567 --> 01:02:56.986
Even Masked Racer has to

01:02:56.986 --> 01:03:00.939
go out on a mission
when he's just having fun.

01:03:03.576 --> 01:03:07.163
But you're going to beat the villains, right?

01:03:07.163 --> 01:03:09.114
I'm okay with it.

01:03:13.752 --> 01:03:15.453
Ji Woo.

01:03:18.507 --> 01:03:20.468
The performance will begin shortly.

01:03:20.468 --> 01:03:22.803
- They say it's starting. Let's go in.
- Everyone, please

01:03:22.803 --> 01:03:26.173
enter the venue.

01:03:32.980 --> 01:03:35.316
You know, well...

01:03:36.942 --> 01:03:39.153
About the show...

01:03:41.363 --> 01:03:44.200
You two go on ahead, alright?

01:03:44.200 --> 01:03:46.076
Huh?

01:03:46.076 --> 01:03:47.495
What are you talking about right now?

01:03:47.495 --> 01:03:48.913
I mean,

01:03:48.913 --> 01:03:51.907
something urgent came up,
so I'll take care of it quickly.

01:03:53.792 --> 01:03:54.960
What is it?

01:03:54.960 --> 01:03:56.670
Did the restaurant catch fire or something?

01:03:56.670 --> 01:03:58.464
What kind of emergency is it?

01:03:58.464 --> 01:03:59.840
I'll explain after I come back.

01:03:59.840 --> 01:04:01.342
Sorry, it's truly urgent.

01:04:01.342 --> 01:04:02.593
Exactly.

01:04:02.593 --> 01:04:05.012
You can't even explain it.

01:04:05.012 --> 01:04:06.722
What's so urgent that you have to go?

01:04:06.722 --> 01:04:07.765
Mom,

01:04:07.765 --> 01:04:10.342
I'm okay watching it with you.

01:04:12.853 --> 01:04:16.190
Mission! Mission!

01:04:16.190 --> 01:04:17.650
- Seriously, you...
- Mom,

01:04:17.650 --> 01:04:18.901
the show is starting.

01:04:18.901 --> 01:04:20.444
Let's go in.

01:04:20.444 --> 01:04:21.695
Dad, hurry up and go!

01:04:21.695 --> 01:04:23.739
I'll go in with Mom to watch the show.

01:04:23.739 --> 01:04:25.324
Ji Woo,

01:04:25.324 --> 01:04:27.618
Mom and Dad need to talk for a bit.

01:04:27.618 --> 01:04:29.036
I'm really sorry.

01:04:29.036 --> 01:04:30.746
O Ran, Ji Woo.

01:04:30.746 --> 01:04:32.873
I'll be...

01:04:32.873 --> 01:04:34.166
I'll be right back.

01:04:34.166 --> 01:04:35.626
No, wait.

01:04:35.626 --> 01:04:37.661
Mom.

01:04:38.337 --> 01:04:40.038
Wait...

01:04:50.952 --> 01:04:54.167
[Hillside Cafe]

01:05:02.403 --> 01:05:03.862
Excuse me.

01:05:03.862 --> 01:05:05.823
What happened here?

01:05:05.823 --> 01:05:07.116
Don't even ask.

01:05:07.116 --> 01:05:09.827
Just a moment ago, a bunch of thugs

01:05:09.827 --> 01:05:12.037
stormed in trying to grab a woman

01:05:12.037 --> 01:05:14.184
and caused a total mess.

01:05:14.184 --> 01:05:15.912
Oh, dear.

01:05:17.585 --> 01:05:19.211
Where did they all go?

01:05:19.211 --> 01:05:20.462
I don't know.

01:05:20.462 --> 01:05:22.256
They drove away quickly.

01:05:22.256 --> 01:05:23.424
Which direction?

01:05:23.424 --> 01:05:25.542
They went towards the main road.

01:05:29.054 --> 01:05:30.755
Thank you.

01:06:17.288 --> 01:06:18.489
Let's go together.

01:06:18.489 --> 01:06:20.366
Han Kyung Wook and Yoo In Goo are connected.

01:06:21.000 --> 01:06:22.097
They fell into the river.

01:06:22.097 --> 01:06:24.136
- Are they dead?
- They might have survived if they're lucky.

01:06:24.136 --> 01:06:25.740
- Excuse me!
- He feels kind of suspicious.

01:06:25.740 --> 01:06:28.279
- Is he a criminal?
- You said your name was Bong Jae Soon?

01:06:28.279 --> 01:06:30.568
[You can leave here dead, but not alive]
A poor soul who lost his home and job.

01:06:30.568 --> 01:06:33.352
So, have you been
spying on Jeong Ho Myung recently?

01:06:33.352 --> 01:06:34.899
What exactly are you hiding from me?

01:06:34.899 --> 01:06:37.434
Sir, nothing serious is going on, right?

01:06:37.434 --> 01:06:39.338
- I've been kicked out.
- How about

01:06:39.338 --> 01:06:41.517
- recruiting a new member?
- I'll do my best.

01:06:41.517 --> 01:06:42.626
I'll give it a try.

01:06:42.626 --> 01:06:44.200
You're talking nonsense.

01:06:44.200 --> 01:06:46.024
You call yourself an NIS agent.

01:06:46.024 --> 01:06:48.552
How can you team up with thugs?
